laims processes; Guidewire Client Data Management that helps P&C insurers to capitalize on customer information; Guidewire Advanced Product Designer, a cloud-native application for insurance product design and management; Guidewire Product Content Management provides software tools and standards-based, line-of-business templates; and Guidewire ProNavigator, an AI-powered intelligent assistant. Further, the company provides Guidewire Digital Engagement Applications, which enable insurers to provide digital experiences; Guidewire HazardHub that allows insurers to understand, assess, price, and manage property risk; Guidewire Predict, a P&C-specific machine-learning platform; Guidewire Data Studio, Guidewire Canvas, Guidewire Compare, Guidewire industry Intel, and Guidewire Explore, an cloud-native applications; Guidewire Cyence, a cyber-risk economic modeling product; Guidewire DataHub, an operational data store; and Guidewire InfoCenter, a business intelligence warehouse for P&C insurers. The company was incorporated in 2001 and is headquartered in San Mateo, California.","desc_src":"Yahoo Finance profile via yfinance (third-party)","sic":"7372","sic_desc":"Services-Prepackaged Software","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Application","mcap":12475184128,"mcap_src":"Yahoo Finance profile (third-party, cached)","hq":"SAN MATEO, CA","exchange":"XNYS","fy_end":"0731","cik":1528396,"state_inc":"DE","massive_note":"Massive ticker details not fetched yet (5 calls/min limit; filled in on a nightly run)","sec_asof":"2026-10-03"},"fin":{"available":true,"src":"SEC EDGAR XBRL companyfacts","asof":"2026-10-03","q":[{"end":"2023-10-31","rev":207407000.0,"rev_yoy":6.2,"eps":-0.33,"eps_yoy":60.2,"ni":-27071000.0,"ni_yoy":60.9,"nm":-13.1,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2024-01-31","rev":240897000.0,"rev_yoy":3.6,"eps":0.12,"eps_yoy":"turned +","ni":9687000.0,"ni_yoy":"turned +","nm":4.0,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2024-04-30","rev":240678000.0,"rev_yoy":16.0,"eps":